(text "02 | 3.3 V supply and ESP32" (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e884c42b-bc2c-5911-aa1c-b8c088c0b034"))
(text "AP63203 is supplied from +12V only. Raw 24 V / TVS-clamped input is prohibited.\n6.8 uH in AP63203 output is a cost selection requiring transient/stability verification.\nGPIO34/35 are input-only. Boot strapping pins 2, 5, 12, 15 have no external loads.\nESP32 pins 17-22 and 32 are NC on this module; do not expose flash signals.\nJ201 UART is 3.3 V logic: 1 GND, 2 3V3_REF, 3 TX, 4 RX, 5 EN, 6 BOOT.\nProgrammer power is not a board supply. Keep its VCC disconnected while PSU powers the board." (at 12.7 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a557faf6-a3cb-506a-a6ef-5c8f1e19ca95"))
